                <head>No. 613<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On March 11 Byroade and Hallstein discussed various questions of mutual concern
                    including the Saar. For a record of their conversation, see the memorandum of
                    conversation, <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v07p1/d143">Document 143</ref>.</p>
            </div>
